<section class="container py-5"><div class="row"><div class="col-lg-8"><p class="eyebrow">About the shop</p><h1>Built around good rides.</h1><p class="lead">Wheelhouse is run by Sam, a mechanic who believes bicycle maintenance should feel understandable rather than intimidating.</p><p>After years of working in busy cycle shops, Sam opened Wheelhouse to make a quieter kind of workshop: careful checks, useful explanations, and fair prices for everyday riders.</p><p>Whether you ride to work, take the long way home, or are getting back on a bike, the goal is the same: help you enjoy the ride.</p></div></div></section>